// 01-LANGUAGE.md §6.3: asking an undecidable question is a compile-time error.
// Context: C and P from §6.1, padded so that the check sits on line 12, column 7,
// exactly as in the spec's error message.

lang C = cfg { S -> 0 S 1 | ε }
lang P = { w ∈ {0,1}* | count(w,'0') == count(w,'1') }

print "must not appear: E701 is reported before anything runs"



check C ≡ P
